1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:04,680
Help! Gandalf!

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:08,320
Help! Help me!

3
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:34,120
Look at me.

4
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,280
Forgive me.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,720
What did you see?

6
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:47,280
A tree.

7
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:53,080
There was a white tree
in a courtyard of stone.

8
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,920
It was dead.

9
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,840
The city was burning.

10
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,640
Minas Tirith?

11
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,440
Is that what you saw?

12
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,400
I saw...

13
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:14,000
I saw him.
